d=\"Antlion Hive\">Antlion Hive</a></span><br>Bring Abel Munt his partner&#39;s pick - <a href=\"#/item/partners-pick\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/5c295159bd14fa9a5eaa.svg\" alt=\"\">Partners Pick</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 577, 670</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"577|670|Bring Abel Munt his partner&#39;s pick\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>3,200</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>100,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Abel Munt says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Abel Munt:</b> B, R, A, M. He scratched that in with a nail the night we bought it.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Abel Munt:</b> You found it near the top? Then something knocked it out of his hand and he kept going down in the dark. That&#39;s Bram. Stubborn.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Abel Munt:</b> His pick will be wherever he stopped. It has cord wrapped around the handle, same as mine. We cut both off one coil. Go to the bottom if you have to, and mind the warriors on the lower floors.</p></div><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Abel Munt:</b> That&#39;s his cord. Same coil as mine, see?</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Abel Munt:</b> All the way at the bottom, with her. He always said the good stuff was deeper.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Abel Munt:</b> Six years I&#39;ve wondered. Knowing is better.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Abel Munt:</b> I&#39;ll hang his pick and his lamp over my pile. Here, take this. I put it aside for whoever finally told me.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"I&#39;ll hang his pick and his lamp over my pile. Here, take this. I put it aside for whoever finally told me.\"</i></p></sec